window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Things on my wishlist: </p> <ol> <li>Start a new, awesome job </li> <li>Create the perfect dating app </li> <li>Stop dating douchebags </li> </ol> <p>Things that actually happen: </p> <ol> <li>Got a job in my dream tech company </li> <li>Created a workplace dating app for said company </li> <li>Was matched with Bennett, who happens to own the company and is also my brother’s best friend </li> </ol> <p>They say when it rains, it pours, but this is some serious BS. It doesn’t help that Bennett was the man I had my last one night stand with. It definitely doesn’t help that he seems to want me just as much as I want him. The issue is, he won’t do anything about it, but then we’re forced to attend a tech conference in Vegas, and I think it may just be what I need to turn this thing around. </p> <p>New goal: get my brother’s best friend out of my system by all means necessary.</p>"; 
